# Folders whose Claude Code sessions may be harvested into SecondBrain.
# One glob per line, matched (case-insensitive) against the folder's BASENAME
# (the last path segment of its working directory). Lines starting with # are
# comments. Used by scripts/import_sessions.py.
#
# Edit freely — add the crypto / AI repos you want the brain to learn from.

aptos*
PYROS*
pyros*
Aethera*
xlmLR
anakin
metadata
Clippings
